\subsection{The Hilbert Space of the Transformer}

Let $\mathcal{H}$ be the Hilbert space of the transformer and $U(t)$ the unitary forward pass. We define the timing operator $T$ via the token latency distribution $p(\Delta t)$, which captures the temporal dynamics of token generation.

